# TOPSCORE MASTER GOVERNANCE RULES (.antigravityrules)

> Master governance index. Detailed specs:
> - UI & Tables: `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` & `AGENTS.md` Section 2.20
> - Workflows: `.agents/rules/agent-workflow.md` & `AGENTS.md` Section 0
> - Database & Schema: `docs/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md` & `AGENTS.md` Section 1–3

## DOMAIN 1: CORE ARCHITECTURE & DATA INTEGRITY
1. ABCD ARCHITECTURE: Strict hierarchy [A] Admin, [B] Board, [C] Class, [D] Data. Terminology: Admin, Board, Class, Data, Assessment, Question.
2. FRONTEND SHIELD: Mandatory optional chaining (`?.`) and fallbacks (`||`, `??`) on all DB rows and DOM selectors.
4. SECURITY & ANSWER KEY PROTECTION: Never leak `correct_answer_snapshot` during `IN_PROGRESS` attempts. Return snapshots only for finished attempts.
5. SUPABASE RELATIONSHIP DISAMBIGUATION: Disambiguate multi-FK queries with explicit hints (`institutions!institution_id(name)`). Maintain fallback hydration.
6. ERROR HANDLING & RESILIENCE: In `api.js`, catch Supabase errors gracefully. Return empty arrays/objects rather than crashing.
7. STRICT UTF-8 ENCODING & ZERO POWERSHELL FILE MUTATION (/learn): Strict UTF-8 across all files. PERMANENT BAN: Never use PowerShell cmdlets (`Get-Content`, `Set-Content`, `Add-Content`, `-replace`) to read, edit, or write codebase files. Use native tools (`edit_file`, `write_file`) or Node.js (`fs.*FileSync(..., 'utf8')`). PowerShell is strictly for running CLI processes.
8. DATABASE INTEGRITY & SOFT-DELETE: Use `deleted_at IS NULL` exclusively. Hard deletes (`DELETE FROM`) on historical results/attempts are forbidden.
9. POSTGREST ASYNC HANDLING: Supabase queries are Thenables, NOT true Promises. Never call `.catch()` on them; use `try { await ... } catch (err) {}`.

## DOMAIN 2: DESIGN SYSTEM & COLOR SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH
11. SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH COLORING: Never hardcode grade colors. Reference `TOPSCORE_COLORS` in `js/grading.js` and `--grade-*` in `css/style.css`.
- Star (★ / 100%): Electric Pink (`#ff2d87`, dark slate `#0F172A` text, exclusive to Star).
- Palette: Grade A Pure Green (`#00c000ff`), B Electric Lime (`#95ff00ff`), C Pure Yellow (`#FFFF00`), D Dark Orange (`#FF8C00`), E Pure Red (`#FF0000`).
- Badges: Circular badges (`.grade-circle`) strictly render dark slate `#0F172A` text. Dynamic PTS follows `getGradeColorByScore()`.

## DOMAIN 3: SPATIAL LAYOUT, TABLE ARCHITECTURE & UI INVARIANTS
*(Full specifications in `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md`)*
15. UNIVERSAL TABLE ARCHITECTURE & NATIVE TABLE LOCK (STRICT INVARIANT) (/learn):
    - Root 100vh lock (`overflow: hidden !important;`). Console: `calc(100vh - 60px) !important`.
    - Native Table Lock: HTML `<table>` elements are strictly `display: table !important` (NEVER flex or grid). Vertical scrolling is EXCLUSIVELY on `.table-wrap { overflow-y: auto; }`. Headers stick to top, footers stick to bottom flush above lower panel.
16. PURE DIRECT ENGLISH UI STANDARD (/learn): All UI text, headers, menus, dialogs use direct English. Sole exception: Indonesian vocabulary meaning.
17. SINGLE-RESPONSIBILITY COLUMNS & DOSSIER MODAL ON CLICK (/learn): Strictly 1 metric per column. Student Roster sequence: Level -> Photo (30px avatar) -> Gender (Mr./Miss.) -> Name -> DOB -> Age -> Education -> Class Exams -> Status. In active roster, Actions column is PURGED. Clicking on student Photo or Name opens their Dossier Profile modal. Student deletion is restricted exclusively to the Inactive Students tab to prevent accidental data loss.
18. EXCEL-LIKE MASTER EDIT MODE & ZERO INNER CAPSULE (/learn): View mode: clean text, zero inputs. Edit Mode ON: cell and header gridlines (th, td) across ALL tables turn crisp WHITE (border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.45); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.45)). Cell inputs have NO border, NO border-radius, and transparent background (filling cell seamlessly like an Excel spreadsheet, zero inner capsule/box). Changes to Name, Gender, DOB, Education, Exam Scores, and Status auto-sync immediately to Supabase and cache.
20. UNIVERSAL LOWER PANEL ARCHITECTURE & 10PX CONTAINER GAP (/learn): Universal 10px container gap. All tables (thead, tbody, tfoot) are 100% contained within the workspace table container (#student-grid-container / .table-wrap). Table footers (tfoot) must NEVER enter the lower panel. The 50px Lower Panel (.workspace-lower-panel) is docked flush at base (0px margin to bottom banner and side panel) reserved exclusively for action buttons ([🚀 NEXT], [➕ Add Student], [📥 Import Excel]), search, and metadata. A strict 10px vertical gap separates the table container from the lower panel.
21. DYNAMIC COLUMN SIZING, SINGLE-LINE TEXT & ZERO DEAD SPACE INVARIANT (/learn): Tables expand 100% width, dynamic proportional allocation, zero voids, nowrap cells (`white-space: nowrap !important; text-overflow: ellipsis; overflow: hidden;`), Excel vertical dividers (`border-right`).
22. CENTERED LOADING STATES: Spinners strictly centered horizontally and vertically via canonical `getLoadingStateHtml(message)` in direct English.
25. TUTOR'S ROOM 8-TIER TYPOGRAPHIC SCALE & ZERO SUB-11PX INVARIANT (/learn): Font sizes strictly locked to `--tr-font-*` scale. Zero sub-11px text anywhere in Tutor's Room. Data cells weight 500; bold 700/800 for headers only.
31. DYNAMIC COLUMN RESIZING WITH PERSISTENT WIDTH MEMORY (EXCEL-LIKE) (/learn): Column resize handles on `th`, double-click auto-size, localStorage width persistence (`initColumnResize`).

