19. AUTOMATIC MIDDLE-PANEL TAB HYGIENE & POST-PROCESS FILE CLOSURE (/learn): Only `tasks.md` is pinned. Maximum 3 open editor tabs.
23. MANDATORY VISUAL PRE-FLIGHT CHECKLIST & SUBAGENT GATING (/learn): All UI plans must embed screenshot (Before) and mockup (After). Gated until checklist verified.
24. CONTEXT WINDOW HYGIENE & POST-MILESTONE COMPACTION (/learn): Recommend `/compact` after completing multi-phase milestones.
